  "abstract": "Serve long context windows with YaRN and RoPE scaling, context-length flags, chunked prefill, sliding window attention, KV-cache memory math and context parallelism. Covers exact flags, defaults and constraints for vLLM, SGLang, TensorRT-LLM and llama.cpp, plus the documented status for TensorFold, Ollama and ExLlamaV3, with a needle and RULER-style quality gate. References split into an engine flag matrix and a quality-gate procedure.",
